# Artifacts, traces, reports

Layout under `artifacts/<case_id>/`:

```
current                 # plain text run id (NOT a symlink)
runs/<run_id>/          # status.json, final_state.json, collected/, derived/, trace/, reports/
archive/<run_id>/
```

Helpers: `artifact_runs.prepare_run_dir`, `artifact_paths.RunPaths` / `ensure_run_layout`. Per-run `CREWAI_STORAGE_DIR` so concurrent same-case runs do not collide.

- Tracing: `observability/bootstrap.py` (`auto_enable`, `begin_run`, `end_run`). `MAADS_TRACE`, `MAADS_TRACE_LLM_IO` (`full`|`preview`|`off`), `MAADS_TRACE_OTEL`.
- Reports from `__main__._persist_run_outcome` → `reports.write_run_reports` (postmortem, case_report, execution_analysis, workbook, handoff, improvement bundle).
- Communications markdown/JSONL contain **full prompts**. Never expose the dashboard or `trace/` on a public bind.

```python
# ✅ GOOD
state_path.write_text(state.model_dump_json(indent=2))

# ❌ BAD
artifacts/titanic/current -> symlink to runs/<id>   # code uses a text pointer
```
